RecGen3D — licensing
====================

This repository is NOT under a single licence, and it is NOT permissively
licensed. It vendors code from two upstream projects, both of which restrict
use to non-commercial research. Read the terms before you use this code.

  Path                         Upstream                Licence
  ---------------------------- ----------------------- --------------------------------------
  vggt/                        facebookresearch/vggt   LICENSES/VGGT-LICENSE.txt
                                                       (VGGT License v1 — research use only,
                                                       with an Acceptable Use Policy)

  hy3dshape_omni/              Tencent Hunyuan3D-Omni  LICENSES/Hunyuan3D-Omni-LICENSE.txt
                               and Hunyuan3D-2.1       LICENSES/Hunyuan3D-2.1-LICENSE.txt
                                                       (Tencent Hunyuan community licences —
                                                       non-commercial; the 2.1 agreement does
                                                       not apply in the EU, UK and South Korea)

  inference.py, scripts/,      RecGen3D authors        Same terms as the upstream code it
  configs/                                             drives; see the agreements above.

Third-party notices for the vendored Tencent code are in
LICENSES/Hunyuan3D-Omni-NOTICE.txt and LICENSES/Hunyuan3D-2.1-NOTICE.txt.

Files under vggt/ and hy3dshape_omni/ keep their original copyright headers.
Where those headers refer to "the LICENSE file in the root directory", the
applicable licence is the one named for that path in the table above.

Several vendored files were modified for RecGen3D; each modified file carries a
note to that effect under its original header.
